&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;In
respect of Non-Current Assets held for sale, the parent company has sold and
delivered&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;two offshore jack-up rigs
whereas its foreign step-down subsidiaries have sold and delivered two offshore
jack-up rigs and one drillship to the buyers during the quarter ended 30th
June 2022.The foreign step down subsidiaries have also entered into a binding
sale and purchase agreement for two more offshore jack up rigs during the
quarter ended 30th June 2022.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The
reversal of impairment (Net) is recognised in respect of certain rigs
classified under Non-Current Assets held for sale to bring the carrying value
of such rigs to its realisable value in terms of the sale and purchase
agreement executed by the foreign step-down subsidiaries during the quarter
ended 30th June 2022.&lt;/p&gt;





&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

